Z||000000||JohnF||11-10-2001||07:02 PM||||TRoday was the day!  Tore apart driver's door to replace dew wipe (pass. side done already).  Everything apart, ready to install - wrong side on hand!<P>Drive 50 miles round trip to buy correct side (had to keep pass. side, BTW).<P>Install new dew wipe and go for a drive.<P>OMG - I LOVE FIEROS<P>All is so well I had to buy it a new toy.  Bought and installed a FIRE EXTINGUISHER!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=52558251&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||12
